# Frontend

Frontent require light mode default and dark mode toggle for both

The frontend uses:

- Blade
- Alpine.js
- Vanilla JavaScript where appropriate
- Tailwind CSS
- Echarts
- Chart.js
- @tanstack/table-core
- ayjs
- axios
- lucide
- leaflet
- maplibre-gl
- qrcode
- sweetalert2


